# F051 expansion: Haiku-generated qrels from prod snapshots may contain
# user-specific content (e.g. travel plans, personal names). Regenerate
# locally via scripts/eval/gen_nous_centric_qrels.py +
# gen_nous_procedure_qrels.py against your own nous-prod-snapshot.
tests/fixtures/qrels_nous_prod*.jsonl
tests/fixtures/qrels_longmemeval.jsonl
# Same rule, second location: generated qrels also land under reports/ when a
# probe writes there. Verified 2026-08-24 that these carry prod content
# verbatim (a mined query opened "Given that France has right-hand drive
# roads... while Malta has left-hand drive"). Curated sets belong in the
# nous-eval-fixtures clone (NOUS_EVAL_FIXTURES_DIR), never here.
reports/*qrels*.jsonl

